         <title><![CDATA[‘Nowadays, you need a lot fewer people’: Laid-off Stelco workers not alone as steel jobs disappear]]></title>
         <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/business/stelco-jobs-layoffs-steel-industry-9.7384487?cmp=rss</link>
